            <div xml:id="d600">

                <pb facs="0734" n="614" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg614"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Telegram received from the Japanese Minister for
                        Foreign Affairs on the 27th of November, left at the Department of State by
                        the Japanese Minister.</hi></head>
                <dateline>[<date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-head"
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1905-11-27">undated</date>]</dateline>
                <p>In reference to your telegram on the 25th instant, you are hereby instructed to
                    express to the Secretary of State the cordial appreciation of the Imperial
                    Government of the friendly disposition again shown by the United States
                    Government by favorably entertaining the desire of the Imperial Government and
                    promptly taking the initiative action to withdraw the United States legation in
                    Korea.</p>
            </div>
